 class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4786" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4786</a> docs(v2): Add tinaeldevresse.eu to Docusaurus' gallery (<a href="https://github.com/HunteRoi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@HunteRoi</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4780" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4780</a> docs(v2): remove docs for alpha 71 + 72 (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4779" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4779</a> docs(v2): beta blog post edits (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><code>docusaurus-init</code>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4973" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4973</a> docs(v2): replace <code>diff</code> codeblocks with line highlight (<a href="https://github.com/Josh-Cena" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@Josh-Cena</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4756" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4756</a> docs(v2): Docusaurus 2 beta blog post (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}</li>{"\n"}</ul>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="house-internal">🏠 Internal<a href="#house-internal" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to 🏠 Internal" title="Direct link to 🏠 Internal" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class="">{"Other\n"}<ul>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4994" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4994</a> misc: more issue template improvements (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4951" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4951</a> misc: disable google-gtag plugin in Netlify deploys (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4901" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4901</a> misc: optimize showcase images (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4897" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4897</a> chore: fail CI if yarn.lock is modified on install (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4858" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4858</a> chore(v2): add external link to community sidebar (<a href="https://github.com/lex111" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@lex111</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4889" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4889</a> misc: issue template config typo (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4886" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4886</a> misc: add github issue template config (<a href="https://github.com/slorber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">@slorber</a>)</li>{"\n"}<li class=""><a href="https://github.com/facebook/docusaurus/pull/4878" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">#4878</a> mis